# 6. Cancellation Trick

```
North 15

South 15

=0
```

```
East 12

West 5

=East 7
```

Always cancel first.

---

# 7. Reading Trick

Read **one instruction at a time**.

❌ Don't read the whole paragraph.

✅ Read.

```
Walk 8 North
```

Update.

Then read.

```
Turn Right
```

Update.

Then read.

```
Walk 5
```

Update.

Repeat.

---

# 8. Most Common Mistakes

❌ Looking at the last movement instead of the final position.

Example

```
North 8

East 6

South 8
```

Wrong:

```
South
```

Correct:

```
East
```

Because North and South cancel.

---

❌ Forgetting to update the facing direction.

Always update after every turn.

---

❌ Confusing **Facing** with **Position**.

---

# 9. Facing vs Position vs Distance

Example

Starts facing North.

Walk 10 North.

Right 5.

Left 6.

```
Final Facing = North

Final Position = North-East

Distance = √(16²+5²)
```

Three different questions.

