# 10. Shadow Questions (India)

| Time    | Sun   | Shadow |
| ------- | ----- | ------ |
| Morning | East  | West   |
| Evening | West  | East   |
| Noon    | South | North  |

*(For standard placement aptitude questions set in India.)*

